# Disabled deployment boundary
#
# This file is intentionally not a GitHub Actions workflow because its extension
# is `.disabled`. The imported staging deployment was removed during the
# repository migration. A future preview/staging environment must use newly
# issued Manut credentials and the Cloudflare-first architecture documented in
# this repo.
#
# When an approved cutover PR rewrites this into `deploy-staging.yml`, prefer
# staging before production. Minimum shape (see docs/PRODUCTION_DEPLOY.md):
#
#   1. Same toolchain as pr-checks.yml (Node 24.18.0 / pnpm 11.13.1)
#   2. Expo web export → Worker type-check/test → wrangler deploy --env staging
#   3. Manut-owned CLOUDFLARE_* / wrangler secrets via GitHub Environment
#   4. No inherited account ids; no Hyperdrive id invented in CI
#
# Keep this file `.disabled` until staging resources and required reviewers exist.
